{"seq":19,"slug":"data-mining","title":"数据挖掘","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-llm","chapterCount":4,"docCount":15,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-mining","rating":{"composite":3.83,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.32,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 数据挖掘 简介\n\n数据挖掘是从大规模数据集中发现隐藏模式、关联关系和有价值知识的系统化过程。在数据驱动决策已成为行业标配的今天，数据挖掘技术贯穿了从用户行为分析、推荐系统到欺诈检测、供应链优化的几乎所有商业智能场景。对于中级开发者和算法工程师而言，系统掌握数据挖掘的理论框架与实践方法，是构建端到端数据产品能力的关键一环。\n\n本知识库面向具备基础统计学知识和编程经验的开发者与数据工程师。你不需要事先精通某个特定的数据分析框架，但了解基本的概率论、线性代数和 Python 编程会帮助你更高效地消化内容。对于已有一定机器学习经验的读者，关联分析、图挖掘和时序挖掘等章节同样能提供新的视角和应用思路。\n\n全书共分四个章节：\n\n第一章**数据挖掘基础**从数据挖掘的定义与核心流程出发，系统讲解数据预处理技术、特征工程方法论，以及评估指标与模型验证策略，为后续所有挖掘算法的学习打下坚实基础。\n\n第二章**关联与聚类分析**深入无监督学习的两大核心领域，涵盖关联规则挖掘的经典算法、基于划分和层次的聚类方法、基于密度的聚类技术，以及聚类结果的评估与实际应用场景。\n\n第三章**分类与预测**系统介绍监督学习中最重要的分类技术，包括决策树方法、集成学习方法、支持向量机和神经网络分类器，帮助你掌握从单一模型到模型融合的完整知识链条。\n\n第四章**数据挖掘实践**将前三章的理论延伸到三个重要的应用领域：文本挖掘、时序数据挖掘和图挖掘与社交网络分析，展示数据挖掘技术在不同数据形态下的具体应用方式。\n\n建议按章节顺序循序渐进地阅读。第一章是所有后续内容的基础，务必优先掌握。第二章和第三章分别覆盖无监督与监督学习两大范式，可根据实际需求选择性深入。第四章的实践篇适合在掌握基础算法后，作为能力拓展来研读。如果时间有限，优先完成第一章和第三章，它们覆盖了数据挖掘最核心且实用的知识。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-mining-fundamentals","title":"数据挖掘基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-mining/data-mining-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-mining-overview","title":"数据挖掘概述与流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-mining/data-mining-fundamentals/data-mining-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-preprocessing","title":"数据预处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-mining/data-mining-fundamentals/data-preprocessing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"feature-engineering","title":"特征工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-mining/data-mining-fundamentals/feature-engineering"},{"seq":4,"slug":"evaluation-metrics","title":"评估指标体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-mining/data-mining-fundamentals/evaluation-metrics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"association-and-clustering","title":"关联与聚类分析","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-mining/association-and-clustering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"association-rule-mining","title":"关联规则挖掘","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-mining/association-and-clustering/association-rule-mining"},{"seq":2,"slug":"clustering-algorithms","title":"聚类算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-mining/association-and-clustering/clustering-algorithms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"density-based-clustering","title":"密度聚类方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-mining/association-and-clustering/density-based-clustering"},{"seq":4,"slug":"cluster-evaluation","title":"聚类评估方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-mining/association-and-clustering/cluster-evaluation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"classification-and-prediction","title":"分类与预测","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-mining/classification-and-prediction","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"decision-tree-methods","title":"决策树方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-mining/classification-and-prediction/decision-tree-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ensemble-learning","title":"集成学习方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-mining/classification-and-prediction/ensemble-learning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"support-vector-machines","title":"支持向量机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-mining/classification-and-prediction/support-vector-machines"},{"seq":4,"slug":"neural-network-classifiers","title":"神经网络分类器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-mining/classification-and-prediction/neural-network-classifiers"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"data-mining-practice","title":"数据挖掘实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-mining/data-mining-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"text-mining","title":"文本挖掘","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-mining/data-mining-practice/text-mining"},{"seq":2,"slug":"time-series-mining","title":"时间序列挖掘","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-mining/data-mining-practice/time-series-mining"},{"seq":3,"slug":"graph-mining","title":"图挖掘与网络分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-mining/data-mining-practice/graph-mining"}]}]}